"<p>After that, drag items to <strong>reorder</strong>, or drop them "
"<strong>into folders</strong>. Hold shift to multi-select.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>之后，拖动项目可<strong>重新排序</strong>，或将其<strong>拖入文件夹</"
"strong>。按住 Shift 可多选。</p>"

